{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/titlecard.jpg?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Cerebral Escape Series is an omnibus that contains 3 different, first-person horror escape room games. It covers the genres of sci-fi, occult, and psychological horror where you must utilize your deduction &amp; observation skills to solve thrilling puzzles, as well as rely on your survival instincts to make your escape. Each game comes with their own unique scenario, where you must use your wits to make your escape from. But along the way, there are forces and entities that seek to hold you within\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>3 Escape Rooms in 1</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/Splinters_Title_Shake.gif?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Splinters</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a strange office, with no memories of who you are and plagued by mysterious visions. As you try to make your way out, you are followed by an entity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/Anachron_Title_Glitch.gif?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Anachron</u></strong> <br>Set in the far future of 2080, where humans have achieved space exploration and colonization. You  wake up in a space station after an incident has occurred. You have to survive and find your way out by solving multiple puzzles while making your way to the escape pods.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/Pagan_Title_Dissolve.gif?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Pagan</u></strong><br>You are  kidnapped by a demon-worshipping cult, and confined within an abandoned temple for their ritual. But when they lose control of the summoning, you are now also trapped here alongside a malevolent demon\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve, Survive, Escape, or else\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2987870?t=1744621722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744621722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/b50179f4363a292a08d0fd91089a26e82686c896/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744621722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/b50179f4363a292a08d0fd91089a26e82686c896/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744621722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3230060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/titlecard.jpg?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Cerebral Escape Series is an omnibus that contains 3 different, first-person horror escape room games. It covers the genres of sci-fi, occult, and psychological horror where you must utilize your deduction &amp; observation skills to solve thrilling puzzles, as well as rely on your survival instincts to make your escape. Each game comes with their own unique scenario, where you must use your wits to make your escape from. But along the way, there are forces and entities that seek to hold you within\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>3 Escape Rooms in 1</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/Splinters_Title_Shake.gif?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Splinters</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a strange office, with no memories of who you are and plagued by mysterious visions. As you try to make your way out, you are followed by an entity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/Anachron_Title_Glitch.gif?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Anachron</u></strong> <br>Set in the far future of 2080, where humans have achieved space exploration and colonization. You  wake up in a space station after an incident has occurred. You have to survive and find your way out by solving multiple puzzles while making your way to the escape pods.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/Pagan_Title_Dissolve.gif?t=1744621722\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Pagan</u></strong><br>You are  kidnapped by a demon-worshipping cult, and confined within an abandoned temple for their ritual. But when they lose control of the summoning, you are now also trapped here alongside a malevolent demon\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve, Survive, Escape, or else\u2026</p>","developers":["Cerebral Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/header.jpg?t=1744621722","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":